+# Finishes the multi-tenant rollout started when account_id was added to the
+# core tables: every table that holds an account's data now carries a required,
+# indexed account_id.
+#
+# Rows that can't be traced back to an account (their parent record is already
+# gone, or the account itself was deleted) are orphans and get dropped. Tables
+# are processed parent-first so a dropped parent cascades to its children.
